 "remarks": "Opportunity awaits in the heart of vibrant South Norwalk! This top floor condo at 94 Washington Street offers an ideal combination of location, convenience and investment potential. Currently tenant occupied, the unit provides an opportunity for investors seeking a property with an established tenant already in place, while also offering future potential for an owner/occupant. Recent improvements include new appliances, and the HOA is actively engaged in updating and maintaining the building. Located in the center of SoNo, enjoy easy access to everything this popular neighborhood has to offer. Just moments from the South Norwalk Metro North station, restaurants, shops, nightlife and the waterfront, this location is ideal for commuters and anyone seeking a walkable lifestyle. A top floor location, established tenancy and prime SoNo address make this a compelling opportunity in one of Norwalk's most dynamic neighborhoods.",
